 nths\\nCategory: Film & Events\\n\\nJoin us as we watch Smoke Signals (199
 8) to celebrate Native American Heritage Month. Young Native American man 
 Thomas is a nerd in his reservation\, wearing oversize glasses and telling
  everyone stories no-one wants to hear. His parents died in a fire in 1976
 \, and Thomas was saved by Arnold. Arnold soon left his family\, and Victo
 r hasn't seen his father for 10 years. When Victor hears Arnold has died\,
  Thomas offers him funding for the trip to get Arnold's remains. Miramax F
 ilms. | 89 minutes | R\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com
