SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:museum,children,play,toddler,family,Art-Studio
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Children's Museum - Program Calendar\\nCost
 : paid admission (free first Sunday for Chicago residents)\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Arts & Crafts\\n\\nJoin us for our annual dough sculpture
  workshop. Shape anything from pretend cookies to latkes\, from cats to di
 nosaurs out of our handmade\, scented play dough. Let your sculptures dry 
 at home and keep your memories forever! Workshop Times 10:30\, 11:30\, 12:
 30\, 1:30 Space is limited in Art Studio and Tinkering Lab. Free passes ar
 e available 1 hour before the workshop starts at each workshop location\\n
 \\nMore info: https://www.chicagochildrensmuseum.org/program-calendar
LOCATION:Chicago Children's Museum\, 700 E Grand Ave\, Chicago\, IL 60611
URL:https://www.chicagochildrensmuseum.org/program-calendar
